Package: tidypptsdm
Title: Daily Monitoring of Pig Performance Testing Stations
Version: 1.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Meng", "Guo", , "tony2015116@163.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Daily monitoring of automatic pig feeding stations (NEDAP and
    FIRE) during a performance test: per station, house, pig and hour of
    the day, with alerts for stations without visits, unidentified visits,
    drops in feed intake and pigs that stop eating. Results are written as
    an HTML report to browse station by station and as an Excel workbook,
    and the monitor can run every day as a scheduled task. Data are read
    and prepared with 'tidypptsda'.
